The local image similarity checker independently implements the standard DCT
perceptual-hash (pHash) and difference-hash (dHash) algorithms, with additional
color, aspect-ratio, and complete-link grouping safeguards. Algorithm reference:

  ImageHash by Johannes Buchner and contributors
  https://github.com/JohannesBuchner/imagehash
  License: BSD-2-Clause
  https://github.com/JohannesBuchner/imagehash/blob/master/LICENSE

No ImageHash Python code or runtime dependency is included in the Android app.

